glm-l2-prefetch-mla: Indexer.forward forks window M (MLA layers)
glm-kda-stash: KDA spec-verify uses the replay stash (GLM_KDA_STASH=1)
glm-kda-stash-fast: stash verify kernel reads q/k/v/g/beta in place (GLM_KDA_STASH_NOCOPY=1)
glm-kda-stash-fast: stash boundary flags from one Triton kernel (GLM_KDA_FLAG_FUSED=share)
glm-kda-conv-split: installed (causal_conv1d_fn + chunk_kda_with_fused_gate wrappers)
glm-flashkda: installed (chunk_kda_with_fused_gate dispatcher + _cast_sigmoid raw-beta tap)
glm-l2-prefetch: KDA core forks the o_proj prefetch (window A)
glm-l2-prefetch: target model forward joins the prefetch branches at its end
glm-roce-gather-route: installed on GlmRoceAllReduce.should_all_gather: dim-0 gathers above 4194304 B per rank -> NCCL; last-dim gathers and GLM_ROCE_GATHER_MAX_SIZE unchanged
glm-l2-prefetch: RoCE all-reduce forks the armed window B
glm-l2-prefetch-c: MoE / dense-MLP forwards arm window C
glm-router-dedup: Glm5NextMoE skips its own router GEMM when the runner recomputes it (vllm#55736)
